= ii
{parent=8c}
{scope}

= Solution
{parent=ii}

$N(2T)/N(0)=\exp[-\int_0^{2T}\beta(\theta(t))dt]$. Evaluation gives the implicit equation
$$\beta_{\max}\left[T-\frac{e^{-\alpha T}(1-e^{-\alpha T})}{\alpha}\right]=\log100.$$

See also: <Exponential decay>.

