$$A_n=\frac{2}{J_0\prime(j_{0n})^2}\int_0^1r(1-r)J_0(j_{0n}r)dr,$$
equivalently $A_n=2[j_{0n}J_0\prime(j_{0n})^2]^{-1}\int_0^1rJ_1(j_{0n}r)dr$ after integration by parts.

